{"id":"b74fca4eda5da9e2","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-discrepancy-communication-bound.md","title":"Discrepancy Lower Bounds Communication","display":"thm-discrepancy-communication-bound — Discrepancy Lower Bounds Communication","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-discrepancy-communication-bound","aliases":["28-thm-discrepancy-communication-bound"],"display":"thm-discrepancy-communication-bound — Discrepancy Lower Bounds Communication","depends_on":["[[28-df-discrepancy]]","[[28-df-communication-matrix]]","[[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]","[[28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 13.13 and Theorem 13.8 first inequality","source_printed_pages":"274–275","source_pdf_pages":"300–301","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-discrepancy-communication-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-discrepancy-communication-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-discrepancy-communication-bound — Discrepancy Lower Bounds Communication"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0da4f753f223026\" href=\"?note=e0da4f753f223026\" title=\"28-df-discrepancy\">28-df-discrepancy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"05ae51253c88d36f\" href=\"?note=05ae51253c88d36f\" title=\"28-df-communication-matrix\">28-df-communication-matrix</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fec568b8ee2173ba\" href=\"?note=fec568b8ee2173ba\" title=\"28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity\">28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"58c74e9d605c12da\" href=\"?note=58c74e9d605c12da\" title=\"28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle\">28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 13.13 and Theorem 13.8 first inequality"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"274–275"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"300–301"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\times Y\">\\(X\\times Y\\)</span> 的概率。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Disc}_\\mu\">\\(\\operatorname{Disc}_\\mu\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e0da4f753f223026\" href=\"?note=e0da4f753f223026\" title=\"28-df-discrepancy\">28-df-discrepancy</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi(f)\">\\(\\chi(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"05ae51253c88d36f\" href=\"?note=05ae51253c88d36f\" title=\"28-df-communication-matrix\">28-df-communication-matrix</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(f)\">\\(D(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fec568b8ee2173ba\" href=\"?note=fec568b8ee2173ba\" title=\"28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity\">28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"58c74e9d605c12da\" href=\"?note=58c74e9d605c12da\" title=\"28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle\">28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle</a> 给协议分割界。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi(f)\\operatorname{Disc}_\\mu(f)\\ge1,\\qquad D(f)\\ge\\left\\lceil\\log_2\\frac1{\\operatorname{Disc}_\\mu(f)}\\right\\rceil.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi(f)\\operatorname{Disc}_\\mu(f)\\ge1,\\qquad D(f)\\ge\\left\\lceil\\log_2\\frac1{\\operatorname{Disc}_\\mu(f)}\\right\\rceil.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任一K块单色矩形分割中，至少一块μ质量≥1/K；其符号恒定，差异度恰为质量。故K Disc≥1，取最小K并用χ≤2^D。原书为均匀特例，本地论证逐字延伸到任意绑定的μ；没有混同随机带期望通信成本。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 13.13 and Theorem 13.8 first inequality；印刷页 274–275；PDF 页 300–301。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第13章的 Discrepancy Lower Bounds Communication，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-discrepancy","status":"resolved","id":"e0da4f753f223026","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-discrepancy]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-communication-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"05ae51253c88d36f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-communication-matrix]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"fec568b8ee2173ba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle","status":"resolved","id":"58c74e9d605c12da","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading"